WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:34.920
"Dear Yui,
How have you been?

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:38.330
I'm finally going to see you again. Has it really been a year?

00:01:38.650 --> 00:01:43.390
I haven't left Givoli Island for the last six months, so I'm probably a little tan.

00:01:43.550 --> 00:01:45.560
We'll come get you at the airport.

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:49.030
I'll try to get in touch with Mustafa somehow, too.

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:52.730
He goes missing sometimes, the pain in the neck.

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:53.930
P.S.

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:57.510
I'm enclosing the picture you wanted to see, that of Mustafa the leopard."

00:01:57.550 --> 00:02:02.380
"Repose"

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:07.410
Oh my God, this is really New York City!

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:09.230
No way! Oh, look! Look!

00:02:09.260 --> 00:02:12.010
It looks exactly like the picture in the brochure!

00:02:12.050 --> 00:02:13.370
It's so pretty!

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:16.940
M--miss Yamate, it's not safe to move around too much!

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:20.440
I guess I got a little excited.

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:24.070
It'd be more fun if Kajika were here, though...

00:02:24.070 --> 00:02:27.540
Miss Kajika's trying to catch Eugene, but it's difficult.

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:30.280
Is that because I said I wanted to see him?

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:34.140
Oh, no, it's because it's close to the anniversary of his mother's death.

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:38.340
Apparently, he stays in Austria around this time every year.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:42.800
In that case, it was really rude of me...

00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:45.380
That's not the problem...

00:02:45.380 --> 00:02:50.100
it's just that he has an ex-sister-in-law who's a bit of a pain...

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:52.360
Sounds complicated...

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:55.450
Ah--once we cross the Hudson River, we're almost there.

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:59.400
Ah! The Statue of Liberty! Oh my God!

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:06.060
Just one word, just tell Eugene it's Kajika, that's all I ask!

00:03:06.150 --> 00:03:11.530
I'm terribly sorry, but I've been instructed not to convey any messages, no matter from whom.

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:13.470
Please excuse me.

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:14.910
He-- wait!

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:18.130
Unbelievable!

00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:23.030
Just you wait, Madame Guryusuyorudo!

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:28.000
The Burnsworth girl again? She's a slow learner.

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:31.280
But... are you sure it's alright?

00:03:31.410 --> 00:03:35.360
Among the guests at this hotel, there are surely some friends of the Burnsworth family...

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:37.940
It's just an American conglomerate.

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:41.890
Our family, the House of Guryusuyorudo, have been Swedish hotel magnates for generations.

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:44.870
Since when have we fallen low enough that we should bow our heads...

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:46.920
to the upstart nouveau riche?

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:50.430
Please, forgive my presumption in speaking.

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:53.440
That's alright...

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:55.210
Where is Eugene?

00:03:55.590 --> 00:03:57.880
In his usual room, ma'am.

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:04.090
Eugene?

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:08.200
You broke your promise, Isabella.

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:10.400
Oh? What promise would that be?

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:14.510
That you wouldn't come near me while I was in this room... or so you said.

00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:19.060
I know, but you wouldn't mind talking to me just for a little, right?

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:22.730
I did empty out the hotel's best room for you.

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:25.090
If you're going to demand gratitude, I won't come anymore.

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:27.750
Don't be angry, Eugene...

00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:30.120
Didn't you know?

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:33.650
Buying your mother's family home and turning it into a hotel like this...

00:04:33.720 --> 00:04:35.540
was all for my cute little brother's sake.

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:38.590
Since you and my brother split up, I'm not your little brother anymore.

00:04:38.910 --> 00:04:43.690
At any rate, your new husband seems extremely generous.

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:46.830
He's only interested in adding to his hotels.

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:49.010
He's always neglecting me.

00:04:49.230 --> 00:04:52.000
Even now, he's busy, moving in on Raginei and all that...

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:55.220
Your hair... it's gotten so long...

00:04:55.510 --> 00:04:57.710
Let's send for a beautician from Paris, shall we?

00:04:58.240 --> 00:04:59.440
What was that?

00:04:59.460 --> 00:05:00.620
For your hair...

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:02.190
Before that.

00:05:02.270 --> 00:05:03.850
Did you say Raginei?

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:06.270
Are you telling me you're interested in a country like that?

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:08.220
What's going on there now?

00:05:08.510 --> 00:05:10.620
Uh--well...

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:14.050
Some time ago, there was that fuss with the second prince fleeing the country, right?

00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:17.870
But other than that, it was a relatively stable country.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:20.480
Recently, though, it seems to be in a strange state...

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:21.790
Strange?

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:25.540
There's been a generational transfer of power among the King's advisers.

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:27.930
It seems that the Head Chamberlain is so in name only...

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:30.960
and real power has been seized by the lower Chamberlains...

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:33.030
I think one was called "Sareha."

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:37.650
Ever since then, an "unwritten law" has been established that would have been unthinkable in the old Raginei.

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:42.080
Bribes, basically. I hear they demand them for everything now.

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:46.730
And then they say that the Royal Guard has been expanded, and the military budget has skyrocketed.

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:50.140
...and it looks like social welfare and public investment are going by the wayside.

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:54.310
My husband had some real estate purchases almost settled... but it seems he's having doubts.

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:58.670
Very wise of him. Who knows what will happen with things in that state?

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:01.500
Isabella.

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:02.690
What?

00:06:02.850 --> 00:06:04.530
Have there been any calls from Kajika?

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:07.490
N--no, there haven't!

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:09.760
Oh, really?

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:11.460
Very funny!

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:13.620
Eugene, this isn't like you...

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:15.750
sitting around waiting for someone to call.

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:17.260
"Like me?"

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:20.170
I didn't know there was such a thing.

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:25.300
You're supposed to be a proud jungle cat, not some dog waiting for its master!

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:30.640
Eugene!

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:32.730
That's another kind of intrusion...

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:34.180
Isabella.

00:06:34.430 --> 00:06:35.810
Where are you going?

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:36.790
For a walk.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:38.780
Come back by six o'clock!

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:41.870
You promised that you'd escort me to tonight's party!

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:45.470
<i>I don't remember making any such promise...</i>

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:50.810
Master Eugene...

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:53.500
Over here.

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:57.510
Um, here, I took this message for you.

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:59.960
It's from Miss Kajika Burnsworth.

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:04.230
So, she's in New York...

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:07.450
I'm sorry I asked such a troublesome favor.

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:09.870
No, it's no problem.

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:11.870
This isn't much, but...

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:15.090
Oh no, I couldn't. I...

00:07:15.300 --> 00:07:18.150
I wasn't helping you for money...

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:22.000
Forgive me... but then, what can I do for you?

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:28.820
If you'll allow me to be of service again the next time you come...

00:07:28.820 --> 00:07:30.070
that's all I want.

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:32.260
Of course. I'll do so.

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:34.030
Bye.

00:07:34.730 --> 00:07:36.680
Where are you going? Master Eugene?

00:07:36.820 --> 00:07:37.860
The airport.

00:07:37.960 --> 00:07:41.340
The airport? But... your things?

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:44.910
I have my passport and my credit card.

00:07:54.020 --> 00:07:56.410
Beautiful!

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:59.430
I mean, really, this is a castle, right?

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:02.540
So... so soft and squishy...

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:04.590
Amazing!

00:08:04.590 --> 00:08:08.000
Sooo gorgeous!

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:19.050
So good!

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:23.770
I can't believe I get to stay here for a week...

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:28.990
All the blood, sweat, and tears every day at my part-time job...

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:31.700
now I'm getting my reward!

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:35.010
But next time, I'd like to come with a boyfriend...

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:38.420
In this situation, you really need a prince!

00:08:38.760 --> 00:08:40.000
<i>Hey!</i>

00:08:42.310 --> 00:08:44.310
<i>Who is it?</i>

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:49.160
<i>Who are you?</i>

00:08:53.070 --> 00:08:55.650
A prince!

00:09:01.010 --> 00:09:03.330
Goshdarnit!

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:05.820
--It makes me angry just thinking about it!
--From your state, I take it...

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:08.870
Madame Gluck-whats-it blocked your call again?

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:12.160
Toranosuke! Where's Yui?

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:13.740
Just as you instructed...

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:16.970
she did some New York sightseeing from the window and arrived in good spirits.

00:09:16.970 --> 00:09:19.900
She did? I'm glad. Where is she now?

00:09:20.090 --> 00:09:22.950
The blue room. Because it's the gaudiest, shiniest one.

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:27.000
I figured it was perfect for Miss Yamate's little-girl taste!

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:30.600
You think so, huh?

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:34.740
Wh--what?

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:38.430
This is bad! Rumaty takes naps in that room all the time!

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:40.730
I forgot to tell him about Yui!

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:42.930
You--you what?

00:09:51.240 --> 00:09:54.110
English, English... <i>Dis is...</i>

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:57.870
<i>Mai name-name...</i>

00:09:58.940 --> 00:10:02.260
Kajika, come quickly!

00:10:03.310 --> 00:10:05.290
<i>You have a funny face.</i>

00:10:05.860 --> 00:10:08.290
<i>F--funny?</i> Er, let me think...

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:10.730
interesting... or weird...

00:10:10.990 --> 00:10:13.000
Weird!?

00:10:13.030 --> 00:10:16.310
I mean, I know I'm not beautiful, but...

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:21.150
how come I have to hear it from you the first time you meet me?

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:24.120
...or that's what I would say, if I spoke English...

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:27.040
That's unusual, a Japanese maid.

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:29.860
J--Japanese...

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:31.720
Are you Japanese?

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:35.840
Not likely, your eyes are blue...

00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:38.860
Where are you from? You're definitely Asian.

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:41.370
Me? I'm from...

00:10:41.390 --> 00:10:43.960
Hold on a second!

00:10:44.820 --> 00:10:46.550
Kajika!

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:48.290
I'm so glad you're here, Yui!

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:50.840
It's been a long time, Kajika!

00:10:51.060 --> 00:10:54.310
Hey--Kajika, did you get taller?

00:10:54.470 --> 00:10:56.920
Yeah, this past year.

00:10:57.720 --> 00:10:59.700
And then...

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:02.630
<i>You got so gorgeous...</i>

00:11:03.230 --> 00:11:04.630
What is it?

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:07.370
You could totally play Lady Oscar*.
<i>(Famous heroine from "The Rose of Versailles")</i>

00:11:07.590 --> 00:11:09.020
Os...car?

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:12.170
Kajika, is this maid an acquaintance of yours?

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:13.300
Maid?

00:11:13.420 --> 00:11:16.990
Yui's my good friend! She's a guest!

00:11:18.430 --> 00:11:20.120
Your friend?

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:21.960
--I'm--
--Ahh--

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:25.080
That is, this is my friend Rumaty.

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:27.440
He's come to visit from Singapore!

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:31.680
Right. My mother was English, that's why I have blue eyes.

00:11:31.840 --> 00:11:33.250
I see.

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:34.480
Hey!

00:11:34.480 --> 00:11:35.840
What?

00:11:36.330 --> 00:11:39.390
Hey, did you really think I'd be dumb enough...

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:42.320
to tell a complete stranger my real identity?

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:43.880
Hah, does it show?

00:11:43.880 --> 00:11:46.420
I'm not going to be ignorant of the ways of the world forever!

00:11:46.460 --> 00:11:47.810
Don't give me that.

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:50.820
You just met my friend for the first time and treated her like a maid.

00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:52.880
That's better than thinking she's an assassin.

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:55.310
She was acting really weird!

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:58.780
Yui can't speak English! Of course she was nervous!

00:11:59.420 --> 00:12:04.140
I didn't know there was anyone in the world who couldn't speak a simple language like English!

00:12:04.170 --> 00:12:06.670
If that's not an ignorant attitude, I don't know what is!

00:12:06.690 --> 00:12:07.770
Um...

00:12:07.770 --> 00:12:10.440
Please stop, both of you!

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:12.900
You're upsetting Miss Yamate.

00:12:13.340 --> 00:12:15.920
Please don't fight about me.

00:12:16.180 --> 00:12:20.320
If you do, then all the trip money that I killed myself at my part-time job for...

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:22.020
will be for nothing.

00:12:22.190 --> 00:12:23.530
Yui...

00:12:24.940 --> 00:12:28.730
Look! How can I make you be nice to an admirable guest like this?!

00:12:28.730 --> 00:12:31.370
You could say she's my Guest of State!

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:34.270
Therefore, you will be polite! Okay?

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:38.120
A Guest of State... okay.

00:12:40.550 --> 00:12:45.130
Miss Yamate, forgive me for earlier. My name is Rumaty Ivan.

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:46.870
I'm a friend of Miss Kajika's.

00:12:47.400 --> 00:12:51.340
Would you allow me to show you around the gardens, later?

00:12:52.270 --> 00:12:54.320
H--handshake?

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:56.410
Y--yes, thank yo--...

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:08.040
M--miss Yamate?! Are you alright?

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:12.270
See, she is weird.

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:14.630
I paid her the highest courtesy.

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:17.430
Do it in moderation. In moderation...

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:20.620
Singapore

00:13:20.620 --> 00:13:23.640
With this, the success of Planets TV is guaranteed.

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:25.430
Don't you agree, Zao?

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:27.420
Absolutely, Master Fi.

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:29.220
Say, where is Lee-Leng?

00:13:29.350 --> 00:13:32.910
Master Tonsen arrived some time ago, the two of them are over there.

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:35.140
M--my old man?

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:41.040
Why did you make Fi President of Planets TV?

00:13:41.230 --> 00:13:44.480
Because he's capable. Why else?

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:46.710
Hmph. It's a transparent ploy.

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:49.600
You may think you can keep me in check by controlling my son...

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:52.060
but in the end, he can't defy me.

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:54.850
You misunderstand...

00:13:55.030 --> 00:13:57.730
I have no desire to fight with you, Uncle.

00:13:57.760 --> 00:14:02.820
I have every desire! Because I refuse to approve you as leader of the Huang!

00:14:03.020 --> 00:14:07.160
There's nothing to be done. I'll make every effort until I receive your approval.

00:14:08.190 --> 00:14:09.670
Father!

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:13.010
Hmph. Fine.

00:14:13.770 --> 00:14:17.130
I'm leaving now, but this clumsy maneuvering is useless, remember that!

00:14:19.890 --> 00:14:22.540
Lee-Leng! My old man was at it again...?

00:14:22.830 --> 00:14:25.090
It was nothing you need to worry about.

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:29.100
Darn the old man. I wish he'd think about my position.

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:33.050
You and Uncle Tonsen are both important members of the Huang family.

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:37.000
So long as my Uncle conducts himself with respect, that is.

00:14:37.420 --> 00:14:41.110
I understand. As the responsible party, I will restrain my father.

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:44.270
Your wisdom is such a help to me, Fi.

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:49.840
I hope so. Say, I've been invited to the President's party tomorrow; you should come with me.

00:14:50.730 --> 00:14:53.440
Unfortunately, I'm leaving for New York tonight.

00:14:53.600 --> 00:14:58.000
That's a problem... you're the leader of the Huang. If you don't come...

00:14:58.760 --> 00:15:00.770
Your tie is crooked, Fi.

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:05.320
Who is the President of Planets TV? You are, yes?

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:11.340
This is a perfect chance to show everyone that I'm not the only young lion in the Huang family.

00:15:12.650 --> 00:15:14.590
Build your career.

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:21.790
Because you're the kind of talented man we need to advance our family's fortunes.

00:15:22.080 --> 00:15:24.250
I--I'll try to bear that in mind.

00:15:25.310 --> 00:15:26.310
Excellent.

00:15:27.270 --> 00:15:29.660
He hardly seems like the only son of Master Tonsen...

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:32.970
a timid, easy to handle person like Master Fi.

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:37.110
He's polished and elite. Men like that are needed in business, too.

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:39.280
If everyone was burning with ambition, we'd be in trouble.

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:43.200
Master Fi did have one good point, though.

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:45.680
As to whether or not you're going...

00:15:45.900 --> 00:15:49.760
If I make an appearance, I'll just be asked for contributions.

00:15:49.850 --> 00:15:51.860
More importantly, are the flight arrangements made?

00:15:52.270 --> 00:15:55.270
Miss Kajika over the President, huh?

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:59.410
Forgive me for interrupting.

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:02.310
Master Huang, there's a message for you.

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:04.340
A message?

00:16:06.930 --> 00:16:09.190
Master Lee-Leng...

00:16:09.310 --> 00:16:10.740
Zao...

00:16:10.880 --> 00:16:13.000
My departure will be a little delayed.

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:14.920
Go ahead and wait in the car.

00:16:19.380 --> 00:16:21.390
This is...

00:16:25.850 --> 00:16:27.820
Thank you for coming...

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:30.040
Lee-Leng Huang.

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:34.290
I thought that was you, Carl Rosenthal.

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:37.830
Congratulations on the launch of Planets TV.

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:41.550
I look forward to seeing the expansion of the Huang Group's enterprises in broadcasting.

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:46.970
Somehow I doubt you came all the way to Singapore to tell me that...

00:16:47.220 --> 00:16:50.410
You're quite right. Well, then, let's get to the point.

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:54.610
His Highness Izmal, the second in line for the throne of Raginei...

00:16:54.610 --> 00:16:56.610
Rosenthal intends to support him.

00:16:56.970 --> 00:16:58.980
And what will they do about King Somand's abdication?

00:16:59.770 --> 00:17:03.020
They plan to manufacture support for His Highness Rumaty in exile...

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:05.860
and force him into a confrontation with King Somand.

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:08.500
Aiming for mutual destruction...

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:10.640
But why are you telling me this?

00:17:10.990 --> 00:17:14.020
My father and I currently stand opposed.

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:15.520
Opposing your father?

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:20.670
My father clings fanatically to moldy beliefs and doesn't see that the world has changed.

00:17:21.210 --> 00:17:24.030
As things stand, Rosenthal will decline.

00:17:24.540 --> 00:17:26.180
Besides...

00:17:26.180 --> 00:17:28.670
I can't agree with our tactics towards Raginei.

00:17:28.760 --> 00:17:32.900
Determining the fate of a nation for the profit of one company...

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:36.730
Even worse, it all started with his personal feelings towards Burnsworth.

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:42.520
That's not all. You've heard that lately strange things are going on in Raginei?

00:17:42.940 --> 00:17:44.150
I've heard a little.

00:17:44.280 --> 00:17:49.230
In the first six months of this year, three years' worth of budget was spent on pointless arms buildup.

00:17:49.410 --> 00:17:52.170
For its sake, the development of new businesses, in anticipation of the oil running dry...

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:55.070
and even basic social services, have all stopped.

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:57.400
Taxes have been instituted in their place.

00:17:57.400 --> 00:18:01.060
The people of Raginei, accustomed to wealth, may not take kindly to that...

00:18:01.190 --> 00:18:06.090
There are already signs of it. The other day, I saw a leaflet criticizing the King.

00:18:06.090 --> 00:18:07.470
Criticizing the King?

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:10.270
Nothing like this has happened in Raginei's history.

00:18:10.490 --> 00:18:13.770
The gap in consciousness between the royal family and the people has grown too large.

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:16.770
I see. That's dangerous.

00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:19.730
Please keep a firm handle on His Highness Rumaty.

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:21.570
He could set the whole thing off.

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:24.220
And... Kajika, too.

00:18:26.610 --> 00:18:28.740
Please hold on to her.

00:18:28.970 --> 00:18:31.710
She can be wild sometimes.

00:18:32.370 --> 00:18:34.380
Tell me about it.

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:39.640
Is she well?

00:18:39.640 --> 00:18:41.020
Yes.

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:44.990
It's curious... When I think of her...

00:18:44.990 --> 00:18:49.700
somehow I can start to imagine there being no quarrel between Burnsworth and Rosenthal.

00:18:50.660 --> 00:18:52.670
You've changed.

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:56.390
Before, you weren't the type to defy your father.

00:18:56.710 --> 00:19:00.720
I was obsessed with becoming like my father.

00:19:01.110 --> 00:19:04.520
But someone taught me that I am who I am.

00:19:04.860 --> 00:19:06.260
And who was that?

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:08.660
Mr. Harry Burnsworth.

00:19:09.610 --> 00:19:10.960
<i>Harry?</i>

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:14.730
A year ago, perhaps, he came to see me suddenly.

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:16.680
And he told me this:

00:19:17.640 --> 00:19:21.490
"If you want her, you can have her. It all depends on Kajika."

00:19:23.560 --> 00:19:27.100
Lee-Leng Huang... I want her.

00:19:27.710 --> 00:19:31.110
Sooner or later, I'm going to propose to Kajika.

00:19:32.450 --> 00:19:34.030
Why tell me?

00:19:34.120 --> 00:19:36.080
I wonder myself...

00:19:42.580 --> 00:19:47.200
I thought he was just like Fi, but I was sorely mistaken.

00:19:47.740 --> 00:19:49.750
What is he, then?

00:19:49.970 --> 00:19:52.460
He's a well-trained tiger.

00:19:52.520 --> 00:19:55.800
But why show his hand like that?

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:58.060
He came to tell me to trust him...

00:19:58.130 --> 00:20:00.870
to not take advantage of the chaos in his company to crush it...

00:20:00.870 --> 00:20:03.640
and as collateral, he told me about Raginei.

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:06.110
He's going for it, that young man.

00:20:06.340 --> 00:20:07.950
<i>Yes, he is.</i>

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:10.710
<i>And on top of all that, to clinch his victory...</i>

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:14.790
<i>I'm going to propose to Kajika.</i>

00:20:16.160 --> 00:20:20.140
<i>The worst possible timing... everything is starting to move at once.</i>

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:22.700
<i>I have to make up my mind...</i>

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:24.790
<i>I can't be swallowed up by the whirlpool...</i>

00:20:25.230 --> 00:20:28.510
<i>Above all, I can't let Kajika be swallowed up.</i>

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:37.210
It's amazing! It's a princess' bed!

00:20:37.310 --> 00:20:40.210
Is there anything you need? Anything at all?

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:43.360
No way. This is plenty.

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:47.790
Lee-Leng and Eugene will both be back tomorrow, I heard a little while ago.

00:20:48.730 --> 00:20:51.350
I'm sorry, everyone must be really busy...

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:54.730
It's fine, it's for your and my sake.

00:20:55.210 --> 00:20:59.130
They're all so nice. Oh, Rumaty, too, of course.

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:02.500
You know, when I saw Rumaty...

00:21:02.500 --> 00:21:06.450
I thought a prince had come in! Isn't that funny?

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:10.430
I've got to keep up with you...

00:21:10.430 --> 00:21:14.610
and hurry and find my own prince to watch over me.

00:21:16.230 --> 00:21:18.960
Are you tired? Go ahead and rest.

00:21:19.020 --> 00:21:21.040
Shall we go shopping tomorrow morning?

00:21:22.320 --> 00:21:24.390
Yeah, I can't wait.

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:28.160
G'night, then.

00:21:28.490 --> 00:21:30.030
G'night...

00:21:32.610 --> 00:21:34.610
Rumaty...

00:21:39.070 --> 00:21:41.490
Did your friend go to bed already?

00:21:45.470 --> 00:21:47.480
She was worn out, I think.

00:21:50.320 --> 00:21:51.520
What?

00:21:51.640 --> 00:21:53.660
Well, you see... Yui...

00:21:53.950 --> 00:21:57.550
when she first saw you, she thought you were a prince.

00:21:57.610 --> 00:22:00.320
It's just funny... when you're the real thing...

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:04.070
Right now, I'm not a prince or anything else.

00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:06.010
Just a freeloader.

00:22:06.850 --> 00:22:08.350
Rumaty...

00:22:08.720 --> 00:22:11.630
If that's what my brother wants, that's fine.

00:22:12.260 --> 00:22:14.730
Even if I live out my whole life in a foreign land.

00:22:15.290 --> 00:22:16.560
But my brother...

00:22:17.140 --> 00:22:19.650
won't ever listen to me again...

00:22:21.180 --> 00:22:23.440
won't ever trust me...

00:22:29.850 --> 00:22:31.850
You have me.

00:22:34.470 --> 00:22:35.780
I guess you're right.

00:22:36.020 --> 00:22:38.930
Soon, Mustafa and Lee-Leng will come back, too.

00:22:39.050 --> 00:22:43.860
And Yui will be here, too, for a week. You'll hear tons of funny stories about Japan.

00:22:46.770 --> 00:22:50.010
That reminds me, there was something I forgot to ask...

00:22:50.780 --> 00:22:52.190
To ask Yui?

00:22:52.410 --> 00:22:54.760
She used a puzzling phrase.

00:22:55.730 --> 00:22:56.750
Mm-hmm?

00:22:57.720 --> 00:23:00.430
What's a "part-time job?"

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
